# Keep the branding out of the Composer dist archive.
#
# vigen.png and vigen-banner.png are ~2.4 MB together and are referenced only by
# README.md and docs/getting-started.md. export-ignore removes them from
# `git archive`, which is what GitHub uses to build the zip Composer downloads
# for a dist install - so without this every `composer require vigenphp/vigen`
# would pull 2.4 MB of images that nothing in a consuming project ever renders.
# They stay in the repository, so the README still shows them on GitHub.
/vigen.png        export-ignore
/vigen-banner.png export-ignore
